---
import observed from './native-observations.json';
const names={hnsw_off:'HNSW · ef_search 40 · iteration off',hnsw_iterative:'HNSW · ef_search 40 · strict iteration',ivf_1:'IVFFlat · 100 lists · 1 probe',ivf_10:'IVFFlat · 100 lists · 10 probes'};
---
<figure class="r56-recall" aria-labelledby="r56-recall-title">
 <figcaption id="r56-recall-title"><span>Figure 2</span> Twenty returned rows can still miss half the exact neighbours</figcaption>
 <p class="note">One observed PostgreSQL 18.6 / pgvector 0.8.7 run · 30,000 anonymous vectors · 300 eligible · exact filtered top 20 baseline</p>
 <p class="legend"><span><i class="hit"></i> Exact neighbour returned</span><span><i class="other"></i> Other eligible row</span><span><i class="absent"></i> Unfilled slot</span></p>
 {observed.trials.map(trial=><div class="trial"><strong>{names[trial.label]}</strong><div class="slots" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({length:20},(_,i)=><i class={i<trial.exact_overlap?'hit':i<trial.returned?'other':'absent'}></i>)}</div><p>{trial.returned} rows returned · {trial.exact_overlap}/20 exact neighbours · recall {(trial.recall_at_20*100).toFixed(0)}%</p></div>)}
 <p class="note">Slots show counts, not rank order. The same eligibility predicate and unchanged snapshot are used throughout. Local enable_seqscan=off exposes each approximate path; this is a diagnostic comparison, not a natural planner choice or semantic-quality test.</p>
</figure>
<style>
.r56-recall{margin:2.5rem 0;font:.9rem/1.5 var(--font-sans)}figcaption{font:1.2rem/1.4 var(--font-serif);margin-bottom:.8rem}figcaption>span{font:.75rem var(--font-sans);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-right:.6rem}.note{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.legend{display:flex;gap:.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem}.legend>span{display:flex;gap:.4rem;align-items:center}.legend i{display:inline-block;width:.8rem;height:.8rem}.hit{background:var(--color-accent);border:2px solid var(--color-accent)}.other{background:var(--color-surface);border:2px solid var(--color-text)}.absent{background:var(--color-surface);border:1px dashed var(--color-text-secondary)}.trial{padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary)}.slots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(20,minmax(0,1fr));gap:3px;margin-top:.6rem}.slots i{height:1rem}.trial p{font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:0}
</style>
